WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:04.310
Well, that’s all for today.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.830
We’re finally finished!

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.440
You all must be tired.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:13.130
I’m surprised to see so many customers come in every day!

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.580
You know, Akasaka-san’s cakes

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:17.640
...are very popular these days. They’re even in gourmet magazines.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.170
Yummy, it’s really delicious!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.770
Good work today, Ichigo!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.870
Good work today, you guys!

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.060
I wish you could help us too, Masha!

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.880
Masha will help Ichigo!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.110
Thank you... but you can’t.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.840
We should keep you a secret from the customers.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.800
Yes, secret.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.320
Speaking of Masha,

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.770
he doesn’t stand out too much...

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.450
He doesn’t?

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.270
Oh, maybe...

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.820
he doesn’t appear very often when we’re fighting...

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.690
That’s not it at all.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:56.260
He tells us when there’s a Chimera Anima.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.870
But sometimes he’s wrong!

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:05.250
Hmmm... I suppose he hasn’t really
played an active part so far...

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:10.590
But, he might be hiding an amazing knockdown-punch!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.680
Umm... he wasn’t designed that way...

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:20.640
Then, he must be able to transform into a super robot!

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.310
Well, that’s not really....

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:31.220
Masha?

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.840
I-It’s alright!

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.740
I won’t tell you to fight.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:43.910
Masha?

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:58.050
What’s this? Aah!

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.020
I’ve found you at last!

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:19.550
The monster that’s been appearing recently
in parks and destroying stands...

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:20.990
A Chimera Anima, as suspected!

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:25.950
For the Earth’s future, today I’ll also be of service ~Nya!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:31.250
Wow, Bu-Ling wants to eat too!

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:33.210
W-What’s this?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.630
I’ve never seen a Chimera Anima like this.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.570
The stupid humans are running away!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.600
Destroy more!

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:43.930
It’s you!

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.100
I remember you...

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.490
Heh, you again!

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:51.060
If you disobey me, I’ll kill you all!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.710
That’s enough from you!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.110
You’re just a kid!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.860
A kid...?

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.610
How dare you, you old bat!

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:03.390
O..Old bat?

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:05.330
Runt!

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:14.210
Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! Runt! ...

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.860
SHUT UP!

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.690
Don’t call me “Runt”!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.050
Go, Chimera Anima!

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.120
Huh? Chimera Anima’s attack
has stopped?

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.190
What? You have a stomachache?

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.290
Sheesh! Oh, alright!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.290
I’ll make you cry another time!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.690
Geez, what a wicked child!

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:04.450
Can he control plants?

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:06.370
Anyways, we have to be careful.

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:08.470
Oh?

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.740
What’s wrong?

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:11.870
Masha?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.830
Masha! Where are you?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:14.480
Masha?

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.440
Eh? Has the R-2000 disappeared?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.840
Yeah. He came up missing
after the fight...

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:24.970
You know, he’s never been by himself...

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.700
Is he out of order?

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:32.120
I wonder if he was eaten by the Chimera Anima...

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.270
No way!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:39.190
We can still track his signal.
He seems to be working.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.900
R-Really?

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:41.880
Then, where is he?

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.070
Well, the signal isn’t so clear...

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.490
Could this mean... another dimension?

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.430
Another dimension?

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:52.870
Yes...

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:55.900
He may possibly be with the aliens.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.330
Eh?

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.860
You mean, with Tart and others...?

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.700
He’s been kidnapped!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:04.200
Oh no! We have to save him!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:08.700
But... how can we get to another dimension?

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:11.760
There must be a door
around somewhere...

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.470
I agree.

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:16.210
Let’s scan again.
We might detect something.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.550
Masha...

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:33.990
What’s this?

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.000
Uh-huh, you ate this thing and got a stomachache?

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.510
Masha will fight! Masha is strong!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:44.630
This robot... It’s the one that’s always with those girls.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:48.070
I guess you’re pretty worthless.
I’ll throw you away!

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.410
I will analyze this.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.350
Huh? Are you serious?

00:05:55.350 --> 00:05:56.410
He’s worthless!

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:00.030
It is possible
that he has some information.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.950
You always act this way, Pie!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.970
But, well, it might be fun.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.960
Analysis option, H-6...

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:21.810
Okay!

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.740
Change the setting to M-7.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:32.620
Masha won’t say a word...

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:36.620
Hrmph, he’s pretty tough.

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.670
Rather, he just doesn’t have a brain!

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:40.080
Silence...

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.540
Heh! You protest too much...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.890
Hmph! What are they doing?

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.480
Ryou, this is...

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.760
lt’s an SOS from R-2000.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.930
We can find the door to the other dimension by tracing it.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.840
Found it!

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:16.040
It’s not far from here!

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:18.450
Let’s send the Mew Mews.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:31.090
It must be around here.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.050
Where could the door to the other dimension be?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.210
Oh, the five girls again!
Looking for something?

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.500
It’s you again!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.280
You must’ve some nerve
capturing Masha!

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.920
Masha...?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:54.840
You mean that strange puff-ball?

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:58.950
I didn’t kidnap him. He jumped into this by himself!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:01.330
Don’t say such nonsense!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.940
I’m telling the truth.

00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:08.170
Trying to fight against this... how silly!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.380
Eh?

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.940
Masha tried...?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.450
...to fight?

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.700
Well, I don’t mind sending him back,

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:20.430
but Pie insists on analyzing him.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:24.290
He might even take him apart and break him!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:26.360
Pie likes to do things like that...

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.480
This is no joke!

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:44.640
Heh! Then I’ll go check on him for you.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:46.110
You’re worried, right?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.860
I-I won’t let you escape!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:50.990
Mew Strawberry!

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:53.570
Calm down.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:57.450
Something happened. They say Masha’s signal has stopped.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.710
Eh?

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:13.600
Failed...

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:16.810
They seemed to have detected R-2000’s SOS.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:18.570
We’re in an awkward position.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:22.540
What should we do? They must be abusing Masha now...

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:24.820
Masha...

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.830
I wonder why he suddenly fought against the Chimera Anima.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.300
Me too. Usually he doesn’t join-in the fights...

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:36.920
It could be that he was worried, right?

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.300
He was worried?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.460
Yes. I mean...

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:45.980
Maybe he thought he was useless to us because he hasn’t really made a difference.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:50.060
Masha was going to fight so he could save us!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.850
I guess...

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.950
...we should’ve noticed
how he was feeling.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:05.040
Anyway, we have to save him! Let’s return to that place.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:06.650
Wait!

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.070
Rash decisions will put you in danger!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:13.960
Besides, we can’t locate his signal anymore,
he might already be broken.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.500
Eh?!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.060
No way! You mean... they’ve broken Masha?!

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:21.470
That can’t be it...

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.510
I can’t believe it!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:28.520
Calm down. It’s not like you can’t fight without R-2000.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.550
What? Shirogane...

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.070
How could you say such a thing?

00:10:34.310 --> 00:10:35.320
Ichigo...

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:40.700
Even though he was weak, he was trying to help!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:43.000
I can’t fight...

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.700
I can never fight without Masha!

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:48.580
Ichigo?

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:03.010
Ichigo!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:08.060
Masha!

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.400
Come to think of it, I hadn’t realized...

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.070
I miss Masha...

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.200
Ichigo?

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:32.530
A... Aoyama-kun?

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.240
Here...

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.670
You’re wet.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.010
Umm, Aoyama-kun?

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:48.600
Hmm?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:54.640
What would you do, if your best friend
disappeared all of a sudden?

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:56.060
Eh?

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:59.320
What if he disappeared and...

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:05.070
If you were told that you could never see him again?

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.120
Let me see...

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.960
I would believe him.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.580
Believe him?

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:23.710
For me, a best friend is one whom I’ve
done my best with for a long time.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:27.300
I wouldn’t believe I could never see him again.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:32.470
He’d surely come help me if I were in trouble.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:38.440
And if I knew he were in trouble, I would
help him too... no matter what.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.600
Because...

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:44.400
I believe that he also believes in me.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:47.950
Believe...?

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.370
Yeah.

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.670
Thank you, Aoyama-kun.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.300
Eh? Zakuro-san?

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:08.140
You mean... we now know where Masha is?!

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:16.050
The way you emitted that SOS was mildly impressive.

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.100
It was much too weak though.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:23.530
No. The SOS he emitted was like an infiltrative virus.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.060
Huh? What’s that?

00:13:26.060 --> 00:13:30.530
He hacked into our computer just enough to emit his signal.

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.250
As I expected,
he is not a mere mascot.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:38.620
Masha won’t...
Masha won’t say a word.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.880
That’s fine.
I WILL get information out of you...

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:52.740
I replayed his SOS to reanalyze it. I can
understand his code better now.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:53.810
That’s amazing, Zakuro-san!

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.720
Now, let’s hurry up!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:57.400
Yeah!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:00.730
Ichigo!

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:01.690
Eh?

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.610
Take this.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.730
I believe you’ll be able to use it now.

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:08.450
Eh...?

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:14.790
Go save Masha!

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:16.910
Ok!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.450
Mew Mew Mint!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:21.450
Mew Mew Lettuce!

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:22.370
Mew Mew Pudding!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.490
Mew Mew Pomegranate!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:25.710
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:52.950
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:19.980
This dome... is the door to the other dimension, isn’t it?

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.400
Over there!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.390
Wow...

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.910
So far, so good...

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:33.500
Be careful everyone!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.950
Masha? Masha?

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.000
You just missed him...

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.450
Calm down.

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:45.790
You’re here to recover the robot, aren’t you?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.420
He was more stubborn than expected,
I might have overdone it a bit.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:52.880
Masha?!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.810
Masha! Masha! Don’t die!

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.930
N-No way...

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.270
Masha! Masha!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:05.100
You can’t be broken!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.230
Masha!

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:11.060
I told him to stop, but...
it can’t be helped.

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.480
Aha, hahaa...

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.440
Unforgivable!

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:18.170
I’ll NEVER forgive you two!

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.120
StrawberBell!!

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:24.290
Oh? You are going to fight against us?

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:30.090
What’s this?

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.430
What are you doing? Let me go!

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.220
...I’m choking...

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:42.220
Bu-Ling?

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.270
I-I can’t breathe...

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.100
Eh?

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:56.270
Oxygen destruction...

00:16:56.270 --> 00:17:00.120
Your oxygen will disappear in less than a minute...

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:02.370
W-What’d you say...!

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:08.790
Estimated fatality rate: 98.88%

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.220
Come on! Eat all you want!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:18.850
Masha?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.310
Masha!!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:23.800
It can’t be...

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:27.270
We can’t do anything to save him...

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:34.610
even though Masha had waited for us, believing in us...

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:36.990
Masha...

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:53.050
Ichigo... Ichigo... Masha will save you!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.960
Masha will protect Ichigo and the others!

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:03.770
Masha will protect Ichigo!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.720
What?

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.730
He can still move?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.230
Heh... Not bad!

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:12.140
...Ichigo!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.260
But!

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.280
You can’t enter!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.960
I’m... not choking.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:30.710
I can breathe again!

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:34.590
Masha!

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.590
Masha?

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.550
Masha, did you save us?

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.510
Masha will save...
will protect... protect...

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.050
Masha, thank you very much.

00:18:47.050 --> 00:18:49.390
You’re our dear friend!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.360
I believed in you.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.520
Ichigo...

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.820
StrawberBell!!

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:19.050
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.060
We failed!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:37.610
T-This is... Ichigo’s power...?

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:41.240
Version-up option, New Berry Lot...

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.570
It was a great success!

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:48.030
It was due to astute judgment that she can now use it...

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:49.580
Yeah.

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:57.080
Masha, I’m so relieved!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:20:00.050
Don’t EVER do something
like that again!

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.040
Sorry, Ichigo.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.010
Thank you, Ichigo.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.970
Thank you, Retasu, Bu-Ling!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.930
Thank you, Minto, Zakuro!

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.490
Masha... promises!

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.560
Masha promises!

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:27.250
I seem to have fallen in love...!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.630
Love is very mysterious, isn’t it?

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:33.530
I’m always thinking of him,
feeling my heart tighten...

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:36.200
My heart beats rapidly,
and I feel a little pain...

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.700
I feel happy and sad, and a little lonely...

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:44.790
So many feelings are mixed together;
I’m not sure what I feel!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.190
Next: “Retasu’s Love(koi):
Longing in the Library”

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.130
Carp(koi) are in a pond, not in a library!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:54.070
Hey, hey! Not that “Koi”!
